:: Untitled Passage {"position":"400,300","size":"100,100"}
A radio whispers your name. [[Answer the signal|Answer]] or [[Turn it off|Silence]]

:: Answer {"position":"337,425","size":"100,100"}
You answer. Across the years, your daughter hears you. The signal becomes a promise. The End.

:: Silence {"position":"462,425","size":"100,100"}
You turn the dial to silence. Outside, dawn arrives on time. For once, tomorrow belongs to you. The End.
